{"last_link_id": 773, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## 主页链接\n\n[B站主页](https://space.bilibili.com/3546724261956069)\n\n[飞书文档主页](https://future-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/Gs3Ow9fSfinMpwkCNuschCcYnab)\n\n## FutureAI Image\n\n***FutureAI Image*** 是由 ***FutureAI实验室*** 发布一款由 AI 驱动的图像生成客户端，支持 GPT-Image-2、GPT-Image-2.5 等模型，提供 Windows、macOS 版本。\n\n[FutureAI Image 下载](https://future-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/S4FrwMVlPikWPWkNY0ncxMl6nnV)\n\n[FutureAI Image 文档](https://future-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/SsUmwYID9iNviVkWtNccSzKZnNg)\n\n[FutureAI Image 视频教程](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16Cpm6ZEqT)\n\n## FutureAI API\n\n***FutureAI API*** 是 ***FutureAI Image*** 官方 API 平台，您完全可以放心使用，一切交给我们！\n\n[FutureAI API 官网](https://futureaiapi.com)\n\n[FutureAI API 文档](https://future-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/P8tuwmPiCiMrRtk5UEYccXDCn6d)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "FutureAI实验室", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [810.9965209960938, 358.5292053222656], "pos": [-199.6079559326172, 2205.8330078125], "id": 510, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## 从 ModelScope 下载\n\n[下载地址](https://modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1)\n\n## 从百度网盘下载\n\n链接: [https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Qum6pFlVusGC-Y0l8fYVbQ?pwd=u7va](https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Qum6pFlVusGC-Y0l8fYVbQ?pwd=u7va)\n\n提取码: u7va\n\n## 从夸克网盘下载\n\n链接：[https://pan.quark.cn/s/7f4b208b46db?pwd=9Swy](https://pan.quark.cn/s/7f4b208b46db?pwd=9Swy)\n\n提取码：9Swy\n\n\n\n## 模型存放位置\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── qwen_image_2.1_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen_image_2.1_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "模型下载",